{"candidateAnswer":"sprained his wrist at basketball practice, tripped on a hiking trail","evidence":"[D7:1 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, what's up? It's been a few days since we talked. How have you been? Life's been tough lately - my son had a soccer accident last Saturday and hurt his ankle, it was tough seeing him hurt! I just been looking after him and taking him to the doctor. As a dad, it's hard to watch your kid go through something like that.\n[D20:3 | 6:48 pm on 17 December, 2023] Evan: It's not easy for us right now, my son had an accident last Tuesday, he fell off his bike and it was rough. But he's doing better now. How are you dealing with all this?","itemId":"urn:uuid:bd4f1433-8217-5e65-ad47-bbe995f91016","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d572f63d8e641d62eb03900cc3ac2e3bc92025025f51e8aab283691a5484b6f1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What accidents has Evan's son faced lately?","referenceAnswer":"injured at a soccer game, fell off his bike","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d572f63d8e641d62eb03900cc3ac2e3bc92025025f51e8aab283691a5484b6f1"}}]}